"widget\",\"settings\":{\"text_editor\":\"<p>Our mission is to offer our clients first-class value-added professional assistance, combined with an in-depth understanding of the particular areas of the business. Our focus is on delivering results, our commitment to excellence, creative thinking, systematic innovation, and acting globally to enhance value to businesses and corporations. Our goal is to exceed the expectations of every client.</p>\",\"_margin\":{\"unit\":\"px\",\"top\":\"18\",\"right\":\"0\",\"bottom\":\"0\",\"left\":\"0\",\"isLinked\":false}},\"elements\":[],\"widgetType\":\"pxl_text_editor\"},{\"id\":\"8f0ad53\",\"elType\":\"widget\",\"settings\":{\"space\":{\"unit\":\"px\",\"size\":35,\"sizes\":[]}},\"elements\":[],\"widgetType\":\"spacer\"},{\"id\":\"d38185a\",\"elType\":\"widget\",\"settings\":{\"selected_icon\":{\"value\":{\"url\":\"http://lawyermolochko.ddev.site:8080/wp-content/uploads/2022/07/noun_Telescope_3608106.svg\",\"id\":5984},\"library\":\"svg\"},\"view\":\"stacked\",\"shape\":\"square\",\"align\":\"left\",\"hover_animation\":\"shrink\",\"size\":{\"unit\":\"px\",\"size\":50,\"sizes\":[]},\"icon_padding\":{\"unit\":\"px\",\"size\":12,\"sizes\":[]},\"_margin\":{\"unit\":\"px\",\"top\":\"7\",\"right\":\"26\",\"bottom\":\"0\",\"left\":\"0\",\"isLinked\":false},\"_element_width\":\"auto\"},\"elements\":[],\"widgetType\":\"icon\"},{\"id\":\"5f2c146\",\"elType\":\"widget\",\"settings\":{\"title\":\"Our Vision\",\"title_tag\":\"h3\",\"title_typography_typography\":\"custom\",\"title_typography_font_size\":{\"unit\":\"px\",\"size\":35,\"sizes\":[]},\"title_typography_font_size_mobile\":{\"unit\":\"px\",\"size\":32,\"sizes\":[]},\"_element_width\":\"auto\",\"text_list\":[]},\"elements\":[],\"widgetType\":\"pxl_heading\"},{\"id\":\"f5a08a6\",\"elType\":\"widget\",\"settings\":{\"text_editor\":\"<p>Our primary ideology involves a deep respect for the individual and client, a dedication to affordable service, trust and reliability. As a Cypriot law firm, we integrate our core values in the way we conduct our business and serve our clients. Our services are defined by Ethos, Integrity, Confidentiality, Trust and Credibility. Putting our clients first is a simple philosophy, but it is one that flows throughout every part of our business and underpins everything we do.</p>\",\"_margin\":{\"unit\":\"px\",\"top\":\"18\",\"right\":\"0\",\"bottom\":\"0\",\"left\":\"0\",\"isLinked\":false}},\"elements\":[],\"widgetType\":\"pxl_text_editor\"}],\"isInner\":true}],\"isInner\":true},{\"id\":\"7868486\",\"elType\":\"section\",\"settings\":{\"gap\":\"no\",\"css_classes\":\"anchor-inner-item\",\"margin\":{\"unit\":\"px\",\"top\":\"0\",\"right\":0,\"bottom\":\"30\",\"left\":0,\"isLinked\":false},\"_element_id\":\"anchor-award\"},\"elements\":[{\"id\":\"9a7422f\",\"elType\":\"column\",\"settings\":{\"_column_size\":100,\"_inline_size\":null,\"content_position\":\"center\"},\"elements\":[{\"id\":\"490f24f\",\"elType\":\"widget\",\"settings\":{\"text_editor\":\"<p>Phosfluorescently engage worldwide methodologies with web-enabled technology. Interactively coordinate proactive e-commerce via process-centric “outside the box” thinking. Completely pursue scalable customer service through sustainable potentialities.</p>\",\"_margin\":{\"unit\":\"em\",\"top\":\"\",\"right\":\"\",\"bottom\":\"\",\"left\":\"\",\"isLinked\":true},\"_margin_laptop\":{\"unit\":\"em\",\"top\":\"\",\"right\":\"\",\"bottom\":\"\",\"left\":\"\",\"isLinked\":true},\"_margin_tablet_extra\":{\"unit\":\"em\",\"top\":\"\",\"right\":\"\",\"bottom\":\"\",\"left\":\"\",\"isLinked\":true},\"_margin_tablet\":{\"unit\":\"em\",\"top\":\"\",\"right\":\"\",\"bottom\":\"\",\"left\":\"\",\"isLinked\":true},\"_margin_mobile_extra\":{\"unit\":\"em\",\"top\":\"\",\"right\":\"\",\"bottom\":\"\",\"left\":\"\",\"isLinked\":true},\"_margin_mobile\":{\"unit\":\"em\",\"top\":\"\",\"right\":\"\",\"bottom\":\"\",\"left\":\"\",\"isLinked\":true}},\"elements\":[],\"widgetType\":\"pxl_text