(1926,10268,'_elementor_data','[{\"id\":\"1eaff51\",\"elType\":\"section\",\"settings\":{\"margin\":{\"unit\":\"px\",\"top\":\"110\",\"right\":0,\"bottom\":\"0\",\"left\":0,\"isLinked\":false}},\"elements\":[{\"id\":\"4e9100b\",\"elType\":\"column\",\"settings\":{\"_column_size\":100,\"_inline_size\":null},\"elements\":[{\"id\":\"a6f68d1\",\"elType\":\"widget\",\"settings\":{\"image\":{\"url\":\"http:\\/\\/lawyermolochko.ddev.site:8080\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2022\\/08\\/faq_icon.png\",\"id\":10284,\"alt\":\"faq_icon\",\"source\":\"library\"},\"image_size\":\"full\",\"hover_animation\":\"wobble-horizontal\",\"_animation\":\"zoomIn\"},\"elements\":[],\"widgetType\":\"image\"},{\"id\":\"799a90d\",\"elType\":\"widget\",\"settings\":{\"title\":\"Some Questions That Customers Often Ask When Working With Us\",\"text_align\":\"center\",\"title_typography_typography\":\"custom\",\"title_typography_font_size\":{\"unit\":\"px\",\"size\":35,\"sizes\":[]},\"_margin\":{\"unit\":\"px\",\"top\":\"24\",\"right\":\"0\",\"bottom\":\"0\",\"left\":\"0\",\"isLinked\":false},\"text_list\":[]},\"elements\":[],\"widgetType\":\"pxl_heading\"},{\"id\":\"a96319f\",\"elType\":\"widget\",\"settings\":{\"ac_items\":[{\"ac_title\":\"Do you charge for a consultation?\",\"ac_content\":\"<p>Two-way communication is very important in a lawyer-client relationship. Many of our lawyers communicate by email or phone. Regular contact with you is critical in order to provide updates on your matter and obtain your further instructions. It is our goal to respond to client emails or phone calls within 1-2 business days, where applicable.<\\/p>\",\"_id\":\"68c1281\",\"selected_icon\":{\"value\":\"\",\"library\":\"\"}},{\"ac_title\":\"What about out-of-pocket fees?\",\"ac_content\":\"<p>Two-way communication is very important in a lawyer-client relationship. Many of our lawyers communicate by email or phone. Regular contact with you is critical in order to provide updates on your matter and obtain your further instructions. It is our goal to respond to client emails or phone calls within 1-2 business days, where applicable.<\\/p>\",\"selected_icon\":{\"value\":\"\",\"library\":\"\"},\"_id\":\"08d25c8\"},{\"ac_title\":\"Who will work on my case?\",\"ac_content\":\"<p>Two-way communication is very important in a lawyer-client relationship. Many of our lawyers communicate by email or phone. Regular contact with you is critical in order to provide updates on your matter and obtain your further instructions. It is our goal to respond to client emails or phone calls within 1-2 business days, where applicable.<\\/p>\",\"selected_icon\":{\"value\":\"\",\"library\":\"\"},\"_id\":\"7df318a\"},{\"ac_title\":\"Does it matter how long I wait to file a lawsuit?\",\"ac_content\":\"<p>Two-way communication is very important in a lawyer-client relationship. Many of our lawyers communicate by email or phone. Regular contact with you is critical in order to provide updates on your matter and obtain your further instructions. It is our goal to respond to client emails or phone calls within 1-2 business days, where applicable.<\\/p>\",\"selected_icon\":{\"value\":\"\",\"library\":\"\"},\"_id\":\"4131f46\"},{\"ac_title\":\"How much can I expect to win?\",\"ac_content\":\"<p>Two-way communication is very important in a lawyer-client relationship. Many of our lawyers communicate by email or phone. Regular contact with you is critical in order to provide updates on your matter and obtain your further instructions. It is our goal to respond to client emails or phone calls within 1-2 business days, where applicable.<\\/p>\",\"selected_icon\":{\"value\":\"\",\"library\":\"\"},\"_id\":\"eee273a\"},{\"ac_title\":\"How will my lawyer communicate with me?\",\"ac_content\":\"<p>Two-way communication is very important in a lawyer-client relationship. Many of our lawyers communicate by email or phone. Regular contact with you is critical in order to provide updates on your matter and obtain your further instructions. It is our goal to respond to client emails or phone calls within 1-2 business days, where applicable.<\\/p>\",\"selected_icon\":{\"value\":\"\",\"library\":\"\"},\"_id\":\"b519123\"},{\"ac_title\":\"Is the information I tell my lawyer confidential?\",\"ac_content\":\"<p>Two-way communication is very important in a lawyer-client relationship. Many of our lawyers communicate by email or phone. Regular contact with you is critical in order to provide updates on your matter and obtain your further instructions. It is our goal to respond to client emails or phone calls within 1-2 business days, where applicable.<\\/p>\",\"selected_icon\":{\"value\":\"\",\"library\":\"\"},\"_id\":\"e433fd7\"},{\"ac_title\":\"How will I be charged for a lawyer\\u2019s services?\",\"ac_content\":\"<p>Two-way communication is very important in a lawyer-client relationship. Many of our lawyers communicate by email or phone. Regular contact with you is critical in order to provide updates on your matter and obtain your further instructions. It is our goal to respond to client emails or phone calls within 1-2 business days, where applicable.<\\/p>\",\"selected_icon\":{\"value\":\"\",\"library\":\"\"},\"_id\":\"321b32c\"}],\"_margin\":{\"unit\":\"px\",\"top\":\"60\",\"right\":\"0\",\"bottom\":\"0\",\"left\":\"0\",\"isLinked\":false}},\"elements\":[],\"widgetType\":\"pxl_accordion\"}],\"isInner\":false}],\"isInner\":false},{\"id\":\"8c5ff1d\",\"elType\":\"section\",\"settings\":{\"margin\":{\"unit\":\"px\",\"top\":\"110\",\"right\":0,\"bottom\":\"0\",\"left\":0,\"isLinked\":false},\"background_background\":\"classic\",\"background_color\":\"#F8F6F3\",\"background_overlay_background\":\"classic\",\"background_overlay_image\":{\"url\":\"http:\\/\\/lawyermolochko.ddev.site:8080\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2022\\/06\\/area_contact_overlay.png\",\"id\":3723,\"alt\":\"\",\"source\":\"library\"},\"background_overlay_position\":\"center left\",\"background_overlay_repeat\":\"no-repeat\",\"backg