omic Law</a>                            \n                                Because the divestiture involved a U.S. government novation, when it was agreed that Phacil would divest its interest in the&hellip;                            \n                                <a href=\"http://lawyermolochko.ddev.site:8080/case-study/metamorphosis-of-coins/\">\n                                </a>\n															<img width=\"82\" height=\"81\" src=\"http://lawyermolochko.ddev.site:8080/wp-content/uploads/2022/06/chat-box.png\" alt=\"Chat\" />															\n                Are you in need of help from a lawyer?\n        <h2>\n                Contact us today            \n                    </h2>\n        <p>Contact us today for a free consultation and let us accompany and share your difficulties.</p>	\n    <a href=\"#\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\">\n                book appointment\n            </a>','Case Study Grid','','publish','closed','closed','','case-study-grid','','','2022-05-31 10:17:15','2022-05-31 10:17:15','',0,'http://localhost/theme_powerlegal/?page_id=2498',0,'page','',0),
