(5274,1,'2022-06-28 02:45:13','2022-06-28 02:45:13','<style>/*! elementor - v3.6.6 - 08-06-2022 */\n.e-container.e-container--row .elementor-spacer-inner{width:var(--spacer-size)}.e-container.e-container--column .elementor-spacer-inner,.elementor-column .elementor-spacer-inner{height:var(--spacer-size)}</style>		\n        <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=occycDAXmAA\">\n        </a>\n                We see you as a partner, not an employee\n        <h2>\n                We Consider Every Member Of Our Team As Extraordinary.            \n        </h2>\n        <p>At PowerLegal we do’ not only seek excellence in results, but we also foster a working environment based on teamwork, mutual respect, trustful relationships and commitment. We want everyone to feel trusted and empowered, regardless of their job role or their years of experience. Everyone’s contribution is highly appreciated and rewarded. </p><p>We see each person as an individual and reject discrimination on grounds of sex, gender, race, sexual orientation, nationality or ethnic origin, religion, or any element other than individual merit. We apply this at every stage of our professional life. Moreover, we are extremely proud that our firm is the first and only Greek large law firm whose managing partner and majority of partners</p>	\n			<link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"http://lawyermolochko.ddev.site:8080/wp-content/uploads/elementor/css/custom-widget-icon-list.min.css?ver=1656383573\">		<ul>\n							<li>\n										Development of specific characteristics and skills\n									</li>\n								<li>\n										Orientation and provision of skills\n									</li>\n								<li>\n										Balance in work and personal life (work-life balance)\n									</li>\n						</ul>\n                CAREER of integrity\n        <h2>\n                Why Should You Choose PowerLegalas Your Workplace?            \n        </h2>\n        <p>We are different. We are not a regular employer and partner. We take care of the pleasant environment, relationships, motivations and ambitions of our people, as well as of the harmony between work and family life. </p><p>Continuous learning and an unleashed creativity is typical for our advisors, and that is the kind of people we look for. We look for team players, but also for extraordinary individuals, who stand out from the crowd.</p>	\n                                    <svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 64 64\"><g data-name=\"19-File\"><path d=\"m21 63h-2v-12h-12v-2h13a1 1 0 0 1 1 1z\"></path><path d=\"m38 64h-18a1 1 0 0 1 -.707-.293l-13-13a1 1 0 0 1 -.293-.707v-49a1 1 0 0 1 1-1h50a1 1 0 0 1 1 1v31h-2v-30h-48v47.586l12.414 12.414h17.586z\"></path><path d=\"m31.677 36a1 1 0 0 1 -.707-.293l-4.18-4.179a1 1 0 0 1 0-1.414l15.324-15.324a1 1 0 0 1 .707-.293 1 1 0 0 1 .707.293l4.179 4.18a1 1 0 0 1 0 1.414l-15.323 15.323a1 1 0 0 1 -.707.293zm-2.766-5.179 2.766 2.765 13.909-13.909-2.765-2.766z\"></path><path d=\"m28.184 30.135-2.784-2.786a1 1 0 0 1 0-1.414l12.535-12.535a1 1 0 0 1 1.414 0l2.786 2.787-1.414 1.413-2.079-2.079-11.123 11.121 2.081 2.079z\"></path><path d=\"m29.576 23.17-2.786-2.786a14.182 14.182 0 0 0 -3.779-2.566 19.735 19.735 0 0 1 -5.276-3.7 5.926 5.926 0 0 1 8.38-8.38 19.735 19.735 0 0 1 3.7 5.276 14.182 14.182 0 0 0 2.566 3.779l2.786 2.786-1.411 1.411-2.786-2.79a16.2 16.2 0 0 1 -2.92-4.26 17.82 17.82 0 0 0 -3.349-4.8 3.926 3.926 0 0 0 -5.552 5.56 17.82 17.82 0 0 0 4.795 3.349 16.2 16.2 0 0 1 4.26 2.92l2.786 2.786z\"></path><path d=\"m26.631 16.587h5.911v2h-5.911z\" transform=\"matrix(.707 -.707 .707 .707 -3.77 26.072)\"></path><path d=\"m23 54h2v2h-2z\"></path><path d=\"m27 54h4v2h-4z\"></path><path d=\"m23 58h10v2h-10z\"></path><path d=\"m48 64a16 16 0 1 1 16-16 16.019 16.019 0 0 1 -16 16zm0-30a14 14 0 1 0 14 14 14.015 14.015 0 0 0 -14-14z\"></path><path d=\"m45 56a1 1 0 0 1 -.707-.293l-5-5a1 1 0 0 1 0-1.414l3-3a1 1 0 0 1 1.414 0l1.293 1.293 7.293-7.293a1 1 0 0 1 1.414 0l3 3a1 1 0 0 1 0 1.414l-11 11a1 1 0 0 1 -