ted as the Arising Star of the Year. Many big corporations wanted to work with Stephen Le and the Firm for their tough litigation matters and seek for the thoughful advices to their business operation in NewYork.</p>                \n                                2008: Received the first award for the quality of lawyers\n                    <p>For the first time, the Firm was shortlisted by Asian Legal Business for the Vietnam Law Firm of the Year and Mr. Stephen Le was shortlisted as the Arising Star of the Year. Many big corporations wanted to work with Stephen Le and the Firm for their tough litigation matters and seek for the thoughful advices to their business operation in NewYork.</p>                \n                                2012: Is a big company with 1000+ customers\n                    <p>For the first time, the Firm was shortlisted by Asian Legal Business for the Vietnam Law Firm of the Year and Mr. Stephen Le was shortlisted as the Arising Star of the Year. Many big corporations wanted to work with Stephen Le and the Firm for their tough litigation matters and seek for the thoughful advices to their business operation in NewYork.</p>                \n                                2016: Rated as the best law firm by clients\n                    <p>For the first time, the Firm was shortlisted by Asian Legal Business for the Vietnam Law Firm of the Year and Mr. Stephen Le was shortlisted as the Arising Star of the Year. Many big corporations wanted to work with Stephen Le and the Firm for their tough litigation matters and seek for the thoughful advices to their business operation in NewYork.</p>                \n                                2018 To Present: Is the best law firm in New York\n                    <p>For the first time, the Firm was shortlisted by Asian Legal Business for the Vietnam Law Firm of the Year and Mr. Stephen Le was shortlisted as the Arising Star of the Year. Many big corporations wanted to work with Stephen Le and the Firm for their tough litigation matters and seek for the thoughful advices to their business operation in NewYork.</p>                \n        <h2>\n                Values You Can Count On            \n                    </h2>\n        <p>We understand a client seeking an attorney is often facing a life-changing event. We extend every professional courtesy to accommodate your needs and treat your case with care. Client meetings with our attorneys are attentive and personal. We take the time to learn about your matter to fully understand the depth of your situation and your legal needs. When you have a legal concern, we know it’s essential you have access to your attorney when you need it.</p>	\n				<svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\" x=\"0px\" y=\"0px\" viewBox=\"0 0 90 90\" style=\"enable-background:new 0 0 90 112.5;\" xml:space=\"preserve\"><path d=\"M57.2,45h9L48.4,63L57.2,45z M34.9,45h20.2L45,65.7L34.9,45z M23.8,45h9l8.8,18.1L23.8,45z M59.8,29.8l7,13.2h-9.1 L59.8,29.8z M30.1,29.8l2.1,13.2h-9.1L30.1,29.8z M43,27.9c1.3,0,2.7,0,4,0l8,15.2H34.9L43,27.9z M58.2,27.8l-2.1,13.2l-7-13.2 L58.2,27.8z M31.7,27.8l9.1,0l-7,13.2L31.7,27.8z M30.7,25.9c-0.5,0-0.8,0.4-0.9,0.6l-8.9,16.8c-0.4,0.4-0.3,1.2,0.2,1.5l23.1,23.5 c0.7,0.7,1.2,0.5,1.7,0L69,44.8c0.4-0.3,0.5-0.9,0.2-1.3l-9-16.9C59.9,26,59.6,26,59.1,26L30.7,25.9z\"></path><path d=\"M34.3,74.2c-1.1,1.8-2.6,2.9-4.4,3.2c-1.7,0.2-3.8-0.6-5.8-2.2c1.9-0.9,3.5-1.8,5.4-2C31.4,73,32.7,73.3,34.3,74.2z  M18.8,65.2c1.9,0.2,3.3,1.1,4.9,2.9c-1.7,1.2-3.5,1.8-5.3,1.3c-1.7-0.5-3.3-2-4.6-4.2C15.4,65.2,16.8,65,18.8,65.2z M8.1,52 c1.9,0.7,3.8,1.3,4.9,2c1.3,0.8,2.2,2.2,3,4.5c-2,0.5-3.9,0.2-5.4-0.9C9.3,56.6,8.4,54.6,8.1,52z M7.5,37.6c1.5,1.4,3,2.6,3.8,3.7 c0.9,1.2,1.3,2.9,1.1,5.3c-2.1-0.3-3.7-1.2-4.6-2.8C6.9,42.3,6.9,40.1,7.5,37.6z M12.8,23.8c0.8,1.9,1.6,3.6,1.9,5 c0.3,1.5-0.1,3.1-1.3,5.3c-1.7-1.2-2.9-2.7-3-4.5C10.3,27.8,11.2,25.8,12.8,23.8z M21.9,13.4c0.3,2,0.4,3.9,0.3,5.3 c-0.1,1.5-0.8,3-2.5,